message: "If you refer to this page, please cite it as below."
title: "Metaudits: front page of a family of research metadata audits and tools"
abstract: >-
  The front page of Metaudits, a family of audits of how completely and how usefully research is
  described in the registries it passes through (DataCite, Crossref, ORCID, OpenAlex and repositories),
  and of tools built on the same sources. One card per audit or tool, linking to it. Code under MIT;
  texts under CC BY 4.0.
